        "node_id": "n_2_e18c51",
        "thought_text": "Determine the maximum number of cookies that can be baked with each ingredient type by considering the ratio of available ingredients to required ingredients, and then take the minimum of these ratios along with the total number of cookies that can be baked with the magic powder.",
        "parent_revision_path_hash": "5740354900026072187",
