        "node_id": "n_1_370faf",
        "thought_text": "Calculate the total amount of each ingredient available after adding the magic powder, but ensure that the total does not exceed the available amount of each ingredient. Then, sort the total amounts and iterate through them to determine the maximum number of cookies that can be baked.",
