        "node_id": "n_3_cc4cbd",
        "thought_text": "Consider the scenario where the minimum value in `min_values` is zero. This would lead to a division by zero error when calculating the number of cookies. To avoid this, we should check if any element in `min_values` is zero before performing the division. If so, we should return 0 as the result.",
